silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_04_measurement_leg_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "MeasurementLegYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_04_measurement_leg_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'MeasurementLegYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Measurement Leg', the measurement_leg_arrow is WeightMeas_3450g -> MittensColimitApex: the timestamped weighing event leg; it is monic but not epic; it does not identify the measurement with Mittens.; also, In 'Measurement Leg', the value_attribution_arrow Value_3450 -> WeightMeas_3450g records that the pure quantity 3450 is the value of this measurement event; the numeric value is an attribute of the event, not of Mittens directly." .
